        "title": "The Link Layer - Ethernet, MAC, Framing, Switching, VLANs, ARP",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "The two characters in this story are the **MAC address** (who) and the **frame**\n(the envelope), and the two devices are the **switch** (smart, per-port) and the\nolder **hub** (dumb, everyone hears everything). Add **VLANs** to slice one\nphysical switch into many logical LANs, and **ARP** to bridge L3 addresses down\nto L2, and you have the whole layer."
    }
